        "PMC11169556::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mn- or Si-containing CrFeCoNi alloys form oxide scales with greater mismatch strain than the Al-containing alloy.",
